<a2ui>
root=Column([a,b,c,f,k],gap="md",padding=16)
a=Text("Veterinary checkups","h2")
b=Text("Schedule a wellness exam at least once a year; the vet should review weight, body condition, skin/coat, heart/lungs, teeth, and any behavior or litter-box changes. Indoor cats still need routine preventive care because problems can be missed early.","caption")
c=Card([d])
d=Column([e,f],"sm")
e=Text("Vaccinations","h2")
f=Column([g,h,i],"sm")
g=Text("Discuss whether your cat’s FVRCP and rabies vaccines are current; these are core protections for cats in India.","caption")
h=Text("For adult low-risk cats, FVRCP boosters are often given every 1–3 years depending on the vaccine and vet advice, while rabies timing should follow local rules and the product label.","caption")
i=Text("Ask your vet about FeLV only if your cat has exposure risk, such as outdoor access or contact with other cats of unknown status.","caption")
j=Card([k])
k=Column([l,m],"sm")
l=Text("Parasite prevention","h2")
m=Column([n,o],"sm")
n=Text("Use a vet-directed deworming and flea-prevention plan; indoor cats can still pick up parasites through shoes, litter, shared spaces, or prey exposure.","caption")
o=Text("Many adult cats are dewormed about four times per year; your veterinarian may adjust this based on lifestyle and local risk.","caption")
p=Card([q])
q=Column([r,s],"sm")
r=Text("Nutrition and dental care","h2")
s=Column([t,u],"sm")
t=Text("Feed a complete, balanced cat food with fresh water; milk is not a routine substitute for water.","caption")
u=Text("Support dental health with regular tooth brushing and annual mouth checks during wellness visits; your vet may recommend professional cleaning if plaque or tartar builds up.","caption")
</a2ui>